@bg eastbrook_track_day
Cam is on the Eastbrook track alone, doing 400 repeats like he's punishing himself.
Alana: Cam. The video. I need to know if—
Cam: It wasn't fake for me after the first dance. I just didn't know how to say "real" to the scariest girl in the conference.
Alana: (very quietly) You think I'm scary?
Cam: Terrifying. I'm obsessed with you.
London, watching from the car, honks the horn twice. She can't help it.
@if Alana_Cam 5 real
Alana: ...Can we take it slow? Like, 10K pace. Not 400.
Cam: I'll take whatever pace you set.
@jump end
